cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Code Review: the 7-layer code review process for any agent harness"
abstract: "An independent implementation of the seven-layer code review process the Claude Code team at Anthropic described, installable in Claude Code, Kiro, Codex, Cursor, GitHub Copilot and Gemini CLI, with a deterministic Go security engine that blocks the merge on OWASP and ASVS 5.0 findings."
type: software
license: MIT
